Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:54.62,OPtl,,0,0,0,,This kind of dream, that kind of dream... There are lots of kinds, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:58.62,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,minna minna minna   kanaete kureru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:58.62,OPtl,,0,0,0,,Each and every one of them can come true!
