Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:03.50,OPtl,,0,0,0,,With his mysterious pocket, he'll make all your dreams come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:08.05,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,sora wo jiyuu ni tobitai na
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:08.05,OPtl,,0,0,0,,I'd sure like to fly about freely in the sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.21,0:01:11.13,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,"hai! take koputaa"
