Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:19.06,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,an an an  tottemo daisuki Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:19.06,OPtl,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh... I love you so much, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:26.82,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,an an an  tottemo daisuki Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:26.82,OPtl,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh... I love you so much, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:46.92,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,505)\c&H7D8CE1&\bord4}The Fishing Hole in My Room
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}"The Fishing Hole in My Room!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.17,0:01:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Awesum, ain't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow! You caught that many?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.97,0:01:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}Yeah! We found a spot at the river behind the \Napartment complex where we can catch a ton of fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.43,0:01:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well... {\i1}I {\i0} did, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:02:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah, but ya' found it 'cuza my awesum skillz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.90,0:02:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Let's go back afta \Nwe grab sum lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon, let's go fishing, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay! It {\i1}does {\i0}sound like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.91,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's go after we have lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I won't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.20,0:02:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Aw... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}Nobi-chan, you're the kind of person who trips and \Nfalls in the gutter while just walking down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So going to a {\i1}river{\i0} is completely out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.59,0:02:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Now that she mentions it, what Mom said is spot-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Aw... Just once, I'd really like to try and catch a bunch of fish...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.93,0:02:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Almost forgot I had that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What do you mean, "that"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:49.23,Gadget,,0,0,0,,{\be1\c&HA5CFD8&\pos(648.857,530.571)\3c&H000000&}{\q2\alpha&HFF&\bord1.5\blur20\fs270\t(0,350,\alpha&H00&\blur0\fs110)}Roll-Up Fishing Hole
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}A Roll-Up Fishing Hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.11,0:02:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}The river behind the apartment \Ncomplex is about 800 meters to the east...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Hm... Maybe a little \Nmore to the south?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.91,0:03:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey! The paper turned into something that looks like water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That means the river came to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah, but saying the river came here doesn't really...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll go get the fishing poles!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You can't go to the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We're not going there...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.01,0:03:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh... It's fine in that case, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm going fishing! I'm going fishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Didn't I just say \Nnot to go to the river?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We're not going there...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}We're going to \Ngo fishing upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Come on... \NI'm gonna catch a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Why don't we have a contest to see which of us can catch the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}I can't catch even \None, tiny, little fish...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You can't rush these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Man, you're so impatient, Nobita-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:04:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Sitting and waiting is one of the fun parts of fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But, but... You really gotta catch them one after another, or it's really boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.10,0:04:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Are there even any fish in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, careful! You'll fall in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, so there {\i1}ARE {\i0}fish here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If we can't catch anything with {\i1}ALL {\i0}these fish here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's gotta be your gadget's fault, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}You're terrible at fishing,and yet you \Njump right in and blame it on my gadget...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here. Why don't you try using this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:32.50,Gadget,,0,0,0,,{\be1\c&HD8C8E3&\pos(648.857,530.571)\3c&H000000&}{\q2\alpha&HFF&\bord1.5\blur20\fs270\t(0,350,\alpha&H00&\blur0\fs110)}Hand Hook
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's a Hand Hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}When this hand locates a fish, it will \Nautomatically grab it and catch it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then, I can fish this time, for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I caught one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.94,0:04:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay, now it's my turn...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Keep on reeling them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.75,0:05:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We're bringing in an even bigger catch than Gian!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This must be... a big one...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.93,0:05:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's pretty big!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.39,0:05:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.52,0:05:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh? This isn't a big one at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh... Very weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.65,0:05:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}A line?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wonder what that is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's Gian!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Man, that scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Gian! Gian!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What happened?! Why'd you dive into the river like that all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wuz pulled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}'N I'm sure dat wuz Doraemon and Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.01,0:06:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Sure you're not just nodding off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wuz dat a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.69,0:06:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's fish at some other river, or maybe a pond...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Aw... It had just gotten fun, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right! I'm gonna catch a big bunch again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Why don't we \Nhave another contest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.95,0:06:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Bring it on! \NI'm not gonna lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Me neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}I can't catch even \None, tiny, little fish...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.71,0:06:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is strange... We're even using the Hand Hook, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Is this really a river or pond?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.97,0:06:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon... It's shallow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is just a puddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.60,0:06:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This fishing hole connects to anywhere, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:07:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well, yes... As long as it's a place with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}In that case, let's fish in the ocean this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's a great idea! The ocean has tons of different kinds of fish, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hm... I guess somewhere in this area would be good...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow! Look at the waves! They're so high!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This has got to be the ocean, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yep. This definitely isn't a puddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Lemme see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And this isn't an aquarium, it's the real ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}They're all so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.27,0:07:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Be more careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.65,0:07:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}{\be1}This is the deep, \Ndeep ocean, you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.27,0:07:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oops, did it again...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}This is awesome, Doraemon!\NThere are tons of fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.07,0:07:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well, yeah. It's the ocean, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}But if you fall in or something, you won't get\Noff the hook as easily as just getting scolded by Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll be fine, I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}But Nobita-kun, you're the type of person who trips and \Nfalls in the gutter while just walking down the street...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:08:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm right here, so no matter what happens, even I couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I knew it. I guess you really do need these, Nobita-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:14.52,Gadget,,0,0,0,,{\be1\c&HD7C592&\pos(648.857,530.571)\3c&H000000&}{\q2\alpha&HFF&\bord1.5\blur20\fs270\t(0,350,\alpha&H00&\blur0\fs110)}Deep Sea Cream
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\q2}{\be1}No matter how high the \Nwater pressure, or how cold the water...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}You'll be fine, if you coat your \Nentire body with this "Deep Sea Cream"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:20.52,Gadget,,0,0,0,,{\be1\c&HA7DAD9&\3c&H000000&\pos(631.857,563.571)}{\q2\alpha&HFF&\bord1.5\blur20\fs270\t(0,350,\alpha&H00&\blur0\fs110)}Air Tubes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.35,0:08:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\q2}Then simply stick these in your nose...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And the "Air Tubes" will make you be able to breathe underwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.81,0:08:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.86,0:08:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You'll be fine with these, even if you fall into the ocean...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey... I've got this all ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So don't you think it's a waste, just sitting in {\i1}my room {\i0}fishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.71,0:08:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well, you may be right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We should...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Now we can catch as many as we want!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Catching them one-by-one is such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Couldn't we catch a whole bunch at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}A whole bunch...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.36,0:09:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}At once!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:16.16,Gadget,,0,0,0,,{\be1\c&H7FB0E2&\pos(648.857,530.571)\3c&H000000&}{\q2\alpha&HFF&\bord1.5\blur20\fs270\t(0,350,\alpha&H00&\blur0\fs110)}Big Light
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.41,0:09:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We can use the Big Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wonder if I caught about 100 of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.88,0:09:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No fair! No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hurry up and make my Hand Hook big, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right! Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.10,0:09:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You caught a shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey! It doesn't need to reel it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Who would go fishing for a shark?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Looks like it got stuck and can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:10:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm so tired, I can't move anymore, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa! Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's a sunken ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.09,0:10:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's go hide in there for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.97,0:10:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It seems to be a very old ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah! Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There might be treasure here that sank along with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, Nobita-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.19,0:10:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The chances of there being treasure in these circumstances are-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.95,0:10:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}See? See?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.49,0:10:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We lost the big haul of fish we caught back there...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But in exchange, it looks like we just found a big haul of treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This chest is pretty big, so it must be {\i1}loaded {\i0}with treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No doubt about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ready, set, lift!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:10:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:10:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Isn't treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.14,0:11:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's an octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's gonna eat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.57,0:11:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then I'll eat it before it can eat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}M-M-My underwear's coming off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as I thought. There were a lot of dangerous places in the ocean...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's still after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Get back in there! Get back in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know! If I turn the dial on the Roll-Up Fishing Hole...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And set it to a different location...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Man, that was exhausting...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.61,0:11:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm sick of fishing now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey... Is this water...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.41,0:12:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon! This is hot water!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm pretty sure I set it to somewhere close to our house, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}A hot spring must have sprung up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is an amazing discovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}This thing's also a \NRoll-Up Hot Spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hot spring! Hot spring! Yippie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This feels so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Why, you two! \NJust where did you come in from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Uh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You pervs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So it was a bathtub...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.95,0:12:46.87,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,625)\c&H59D677&\bord4}The Time Machine Disappeared!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}"The Time Machine Disappeared!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:12:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.62,0:12:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What is it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Come here a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yes, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.06,0:13:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh! What am I going to do with that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.35,0:13:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Put your things away when you're done playing wi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.87,0:13:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Monster! Monster! Monster! Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And back in you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.05,0:13:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This "Monster Ball" sure is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You really scared me, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.06,0:13:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There's no use hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.03,0:13:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ha! She doesn't know about the Time Machine being here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.67,0:14:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh? You {\i1}ARE{\i0} here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.30,0:14:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Hey, Doraemon.\NThat was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.17,0:14:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You see, I took the Monster Ball you lent me, and used it on Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?! You shouldn't use my gadgets to play pranks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.68,0:14:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But all she ever does is nag and yell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}If I leave anything out when I'm done \Nwith it, she yells, "pick this up" and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.43,0:14:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Mom is absolutely right to be mad at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I mean look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You left the door to the Time Machine wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Every single time! You use something, and leave it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.09,0:14:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You open something, and leave it open...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.59,0:14:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The Time Machine's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.91,0:14:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}I bet you forgot \Nto put on the brake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And now it got pushed down the time stream somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Without that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We can't go anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.33,0:14:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And I can never go back to the future, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is all my fault! What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Come on... Crying doesn't solve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.05,0:15:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's just sit and think of a way to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah! Think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}What should we do? \NDid you think of something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}How's it going? Anything yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.89,0:15:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hurry and think of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Can you just be quiet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Running around going on and on! \NThis is what we've been dealt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Dealt...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Belt...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The belts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.21,0:15:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Did you think of something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:21.61,Gadget,,0,0,0,,{\be1\c&HD9C4BE&\pos(648,545)\3c&H000000&}{\q2\alpha&HFF&\bord1.5\blur20\fs270\t(0,350,\alpha&H00&\blur0\fs110)}Time Belt
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I have some Time Belts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's a "Time Belt"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}These can't move change locations, but they have the ability to time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So let's chase after the Time Machine with these!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.04,0:15:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But we don't know where the Time Machine went, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.89,0:15:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I have a Time Sensor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The Time Machine leaves waves along its path in the time stream...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So we can follow those right to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's picked up the Time Machine's waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.38,0:15:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's flowing farther and farther back in time. Let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:15:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}About when are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We just went past the 1600's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.03,0:16:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We're getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.45,0:16:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Only 200 years to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.25,0:16:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}100 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.37,0:16:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}50 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh? The waves stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.21,0:16:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It was just a little farther, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Did the Machine take a detour and get stuck in some other time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.05,0:16:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}For now, let's get out of the time stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.47,0:16:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oww...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh? Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.56,0:16:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Like I said, we don't change locations!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is where your room is, Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.62,0:16:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Only we're 1866 years in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow! So that means that my house will be built where I'm standing right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So I go down the stairs like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And the entryway would be right around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.03,0:16:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The kitchen would be there... And the bathroom would be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We've gotta hurry and find the Time Machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.04,0:16:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So, where should we look?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:16:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}I don't know. If I consider the direction of the vortexes in the time stream...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.95,0:17:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It should have been sent downstream to the west, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Anyways, let's just go scout the area!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.64,0:17:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.06,0:17:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All I can see is grass and trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.56,0:17:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It may be difficult to find from up here in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I guess all we can do is look for a village and ask someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.07,0:17:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\i1}ARE {\i0}there any villages?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.07,0:17:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Villages in this era are {\i1}very {\i0}small...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.03,0:17:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So if you don't look carefully, you might miss one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.07,0:17:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Even so, I still can't find one...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.50,0:17:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Our Bamboo 'Copters are making weird noises.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.81,0:17:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, no! The batteries...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just died!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oww...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.27,0:17:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll pull out a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.05,0:17:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But I don't have very many, so we've got to use them carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Why is Japan so big...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wonder if we can actually find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.07,0:18:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No "wondering" about if we'll find it! We HAVE to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Besides, we got into this mess because you're so careless, Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.99,0:18:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Shh... Something's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.62,0:18:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah! That scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.06,0:18:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.27,0:18:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It looks like something scared them, and they all instinctively ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wonder what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.32,0:18:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wait, could it have been the Time Machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.15,0:18:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.07,0:18:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's go check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Aw... Let's just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then wait right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's that sound...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.24,0:19:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It sounds like something big and heavy being dragged around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The trees and grass...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Are all trampled down and torn apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What went through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.96,0:19:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Who knows...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, no! Those are...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.26,0:19:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Way over there, deep in the mountains...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.23,0:19:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\q0}{\be1}It's the eyes of a \Npack of giant monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.19,0:19:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Are those dinosaurs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2\be1}We know dinosaurs went extinct tens of millions \Nof years before humanity came into existence!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then what are those things?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah! They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Make the bonfire much, much bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.21,0:19:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Momotaro Jirushi's Millet Dumplings!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.21,0:19:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}These will tame the beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But I still feel helpless with just those!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.65,0:20:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Pull out a bunch more stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.47,0:20:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.22,0:20:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The Sure-Hit Slingshot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.28,0:20:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The Small Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.59,0:20:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The Hypnosis Machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And an RC Robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's still not enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.91,0:20:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Okay... \NIn that case...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.23,0:20:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll pull out everything I think we can use!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right! If you're gonna come, then come and bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.23,0:20:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}But if possible, \Nplease {\i1}DON'T {\i0}come!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I didn't get enough sleep, so I'm really dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And in the end, they didn't come out, anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.25,0:20:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well, it's best that they didn't come out, but what were they, anyway...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.21,0:20:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Should we look upstream, downstream, or go across?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Any of those is fine, let's just use the Bamboo 'Copters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No! I don't have many left, so if we can do it ourselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.22,0:20:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.27,0:20:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.73,0:20:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right! Some chopsticks came floating downstream!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.23,0:21:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Well, of course the chopstick float. \NThey're made of wood, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's not what I meant. Chopsticks floating downstream...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.99,0:21:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Is a sign of people living upstream, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.15,0:21:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.95,0:21:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.85,0:21:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hurry up, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's a village!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If we ask there, we might figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.17,0:21:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.77,0:21:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Maybe there's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.75,0:21:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah, it's awfully quiet...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}It's all gloomy and \Ngives me the creeps...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.13,0:21:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Someone's crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.80,0:21:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And it sounds like a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.26,0:22:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Excuse me..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.72,0:22:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.87,0:22:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.10,0:22:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, I don't know what he's saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.41,0:22:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Japanese in this time was different from modern Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.36,0:22:24.57,Gadget,,0,0,0,,{\be1\c&HC7DAE5&\pos(648,545)\3c&H000000&}{\q2\alpha&HFF&\bord1.5\blur20\fs270\t(0,350,\alpha&H00&\blur0\fs110)}Translation Konjac
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.82,0:22:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So here's a Translation Konjac!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.77,0:22:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If we eat some of this, we can understand his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay, let's start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}T-That raccoon just spoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.62,0:22:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Don't be rude! I'm {\i1}NOT {\i0}a raccoon, I'm a cat-model robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.64,0:22:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ro...bot...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.06,0:22:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.09,0:22:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I see. This be a magical, transformed raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.09,0:22:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Moving on, what happened to everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.72,0:22:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We have angered him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.44,0:22:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We have earned the wrath of the Eight-Headed Serpent...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:22:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The Eight-Headed Serpent?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.57,0:22:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.86,0:23:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You've never heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.85,0:23:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}It's a ancient mythological snake monster with \Neight heads, and is said to be as big as a mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.85,0:23:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Eight heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.55,0:23:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey! Could that be the thing with red eyes we saw last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.53,0:23:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.85,0:23:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But to think that such a monster is real...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.25,0:23:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It happened about 6 months ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The serpent suddenly appeared, and rampaged through our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.50,0:23:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Ever since then, the serpent will often appear and begin rampaging anew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.93,0:23:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Our men fought back, but they were no match for it...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.27,0:23:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And so, in order to appease the serpent's anger...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We are going to offer my daughter as a sacrifice to it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.23,0:23:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}That's awful! \NReally, really awful of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.52,0:23:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}However, this has already been decided upon by the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.03,0:23:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.01,0:24:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Please forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.83,0:24:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is for the safety of our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.62,0:24:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.96,0:24:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We... {\alpha&HFF&}will destroy the serpent!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.09,0:24:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We... will destroy the serpent!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.26,0:24:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.59,0:24:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.84,0:24:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Oh, mighty Eight-Headed Serpent! We humbly offer you a sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.32,0:24:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Please spare us our lives, and do not lay waste to our village!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.81,0:24:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay, now flee to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.57,0:24:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}If you hesitate, \Nthe serpent will get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.58,0:25:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wonder if this serpent will really come?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.61,0:25:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey... Is this really going to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.15,0:25:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Like I told you before, according to the legend...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.07,0:25:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}A man known as Susanoo-no-Mikoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.18,0:25:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let the Eight-Headed Serpent drink a ton of Japanese liquor, or {\i1}sake{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.01,0:25:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And once it was completely drunk...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.22,0:25:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He brought it down in one go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.98,0:25:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But can it really be that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.88,0:25:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Hey, it works \Naccording to the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.15,0:25:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Don't be so irresponsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.98,0:25:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What else can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.31,0:25:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We don't know what kind of thing this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.86,0:25:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Besides, {\i1}YOU'RE{\i0} the one who said "We will destroy the serpent!"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.59,0:25:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}We got into this mess because YOU always \Nhave to try to look cool in front of girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.83,0:25:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, wait! This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.21,0:25:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The same place we saw last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.36,0:26:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Was the monster from last night the Eight-Heated Serpent, after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.84,0:26:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's "Eight-{\i1}HEADED{\i0}", not "Eight-Heated"!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.87,0:26:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Now, listen. It has eight heads, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.09,0:26:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It has eight {\i1}separate {\i0}heads, so we say it's "eight-headed".
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.12,0:26:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.35,0:26:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's still weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.13,0:26:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You said it's named that because it has eight separate heads...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.50,0:26:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But it has seven separations.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.50,0:26:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That means it should be called the Seven-Headed Serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.82,0:26:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Anyways! It was decided to call it the Eight-Headed Serpent a long time ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.07,0:26:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But why was that decided?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.83,0:26:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Come on, why? Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.10,0:26:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Come on, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.88,0:26:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Gah! Now's not the time to be worrying about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.83,0:26:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ha! You're scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.14,0:26:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Cause you can't think of an answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.85,0:26:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}T-There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.46,0:26:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, what about our plan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.07,0:26:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.81,0:27:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.86,0:27:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, mighty serpent...!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.17,0:27:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here's some nice, delicious {\i1}sake{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.62,0:27:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Go on, help yourself to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.51,0:27:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right! It's drinking it, exactly according to plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.47,0:27:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And now the serpent's completely drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.81,0:27:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's not drunk at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.85,0:27:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I guess it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.63,0:27:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Don't just run! Use Momotaro Jirushi's Millet Dumplings!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.86,0:27:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.91,0:27:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Momotaro Jirushi's Millet Dumplings!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.86,0:27:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Take this, and this, and that!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.83,0:28:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Oh, no! They had \Nabsolutely no effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.84,0:28:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.13,0:28:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.93,0:28:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon, use some kind of gadget!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.89,0:28:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The Sure-Hit Slingshot!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.88,0:28:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And the Small Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.85,0:28:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.84,0:28:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}They didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.81,0:28:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The Hypnosis Machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.06,0:28:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And the Air Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.91,0:28:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Not even one of them worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.32,0:28:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Since it comes to this, we need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.91,0:28:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.92,0:28:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's a thicket of grass! Run into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.56,0:28:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's it! It's getting confused!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.43,0:28:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.10,0:28:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.19,0:29:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.70,0:29:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\t(1500,2500,\fs60\alpha&HFF)}Nobita-kun...!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.72,0:29:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.60,0:29:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.45,0:29:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's the Monster Ball! And the Time Machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.14,0:29:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.94,0:29:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.90,0:29:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That was an illusion created by the Monster Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.43,0:29:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's why none of my gadgets had any effect on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.52,0:29:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}But that means someone had to have pushed \Nthe "Eight-Headed Serpent" switch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.56,0:29:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}A monkey or something must have played with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.49,0:30:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So the Time Machine drifted down and landed here six months before us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.06,0:30:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.87,0:30:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh. So it was all an illusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.88,0:30:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And everyone got all worked up about it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.75,0:30:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.79,0:30:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\i1}YOUR{\i0} carelessness is what caused all of this in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.42,0:30:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.43,0:30:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, it's that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.84,0:30:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No! We're going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.68,0:30:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Aw...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.47,0:30:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I brought down the serpent and all...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.66,0:30:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}So I wanted to hear her say \N"Wow, Nobita-san! You're so wonderful!"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.86,0:30:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}"Brought down the serpent"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.44,0:30:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}Are you even thinking about how much \Ntrouble you caused the people in that village?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.57,0:30:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Regardless, we can't risk changing history any more than we already have!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.61,0:30:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.57,0:30:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay, okay... I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.83,0:30:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita...?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.83,0:30:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.38,0:30:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.51,0:30:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Honestly! You leave {\i1}everything {\i0}laying around!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.94,0:30:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You better start being more tidy and cautious from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.45,0:31:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}I got it the first time you said that.\NYou don't need to keep repeating.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.85,0:31:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}More importantly, why did they call it \N"Eight-Headed" when there are only seven separations?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.85,0:31:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Come on, tell me! Why? Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.86,0:31:22.78,Title,,0,0,0,,{\c&H8DF3E3&\bord4\pos(656,599)}Remember How You Felt That Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.92,0:31:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}"Remember How You Felt That Day!"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.33,0:31:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\i1}WAKE... UP!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.04,0:31:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What time do you think it is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.54,0:31:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, no! I'm late, again!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.00,0:31:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}I'm gonna get scolded again!\NI'm gonna have to stand in the hall again!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.54,0:31:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You never learn, and keep doing the same thing morning after morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.58,0:31:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is really getting sickening.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.93,0:31:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Man... You're right. This has gotten sickening.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.05,0:31:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Anything and everything has gotten sickening.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.26,0:31:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}"Anything" is taking it a little too far...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.82,0:31:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know! I'll just stop going to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.81,0:31:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.73,0:31:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Today's school system isn't geared towards me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.03,0:31:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So even if you try to stop me, Doraemon...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.36,0:31:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Or my teacher gets mad at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.81,0:31:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Or my parents cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.65,0:32:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm dropping out of school today!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.74,0:32:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No matter what might have happened, that's completely absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.28,0:32:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.45,0:32:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}I'll start writing up my \N"Dropping Out of School Notice" right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.79,0:32:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What kind of stupid things are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.96,0:32:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What kind of stupid things are you causing a commotion about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.00,0:32:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}U-Um... Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.65,0:32:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun said he wasn't going to go to school, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.66,0:32:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.79,0:32:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What? Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.26,0:32:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Because today's Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.40,0:32:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oops...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.78,0:32:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No, um... Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.84,0:32:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well, anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.41,0:32:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.35,0:32:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Enough of this! Get downstairs and eat your breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.99,0:32:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's a real pain if I can't clean things up!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.47,0:32:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yes, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.28,0:32:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Mom's in a really bad mood this morning, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.03,0:32:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.28,0:32:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}So that's why!\NMom and Dad are fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.66,0:32:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}How about we go to Shizuka-chan's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.81,0:32:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Even if I went, it's nothing special...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.25,0:33:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm sure it'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.26,0:33:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Man, everything's {\i1}SO{\i0} boring...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.55,0:33:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}I just repeat the \Nsame thing everyday...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.00,0:33:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm tired of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.21,0:33:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.43,0:33:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Everything's meaningless...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.56,0:33:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's all the the same plain, predictable old rut...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is really getting out of hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.27,0:33:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll use this on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.57,0:33:27.53,Gadget,,0,0,0,,{\be1\c&HBEC0D8&\pos(648,545)\3c&H000000&}{\q2\alpha&HFF&\bord1.5\blur20\fs270\t(0,350,\alpha&H00&\blur0\fs110)}First-Time Stamp
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.86,0:33:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The First-Time Stamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.74,0:33:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.60,0:33:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}For now, let's just go to Shizuka-chan's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.66,0:33:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Shizuka-chan! \NWe came to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.25,0:33:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}But even if I talk to Shizuka-chan, \Nit's still the same, old thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.30,0:33:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Come on, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.86,0:33:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Is that Nobita-san and Dora-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.26,0:33:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}First-Time...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.76,0:33:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Stamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.52,0:33:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.03,0:33:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.28,0:34:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You're... Shizuka-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.03,0:34:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well, yes... But why do you ask...?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.03,0:34:13.86,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}S-She's {\i1}SO{\i0} cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.86,0:34:16.04,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\blur3}I've liked her \Neven up to now...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.04,0:34:20.04,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\blur3}But Shizuka-chan hasn't \Nseemed this attractive since...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.54,0:34:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}What happened to you? \NYou're acting like it's the first time we met...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.94,0:34:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.05,0:34:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}That voice... \NIt's so entrancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.55,0:34:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.55,0:34:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}To think that I have such a wonderful girl for a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.27,0:34:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You're over exaggerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.93,0:34:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This game is so much fun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.85,0:34:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But it's the one we always play...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.96,0:34:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Haven't you already read that dozens of times?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.28,0:34:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun, would you like to have lunch with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.53,0:34:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Lunch with Shizuka-chan's family!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.41,0:34:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}This is like a dream.\NI'll gladly eat with you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.54,0:35:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I just threw together some random side dishes we had on hand, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.06,0:35:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Not at all! They all have a such new taste, and they're so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.26,0:35:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.55,0:35:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I never realized the sunset was this beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.00,0:35:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.75,0:35:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm really jealous of you, Nobita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.56,0:35:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}You're like a small child who's curious about \Nand can get engrossed in everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.78,0:35:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Today was a really fun day!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.28,0:35:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.74,0:35:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}'Ey! Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.87,0:35:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.10,0:35:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ya' skipped out on our game t'day!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.49,0:35:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I bet you forgot again, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.29,0:35:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Gian! Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.99,0:35:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Look at those round, kind eyes! And that strong, protective body!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.47,0:35:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What sharp lips! And such a unique hairstyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.02,0:35:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I have such wonderful friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.12,0:35:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Wut's wit ya'?! \NYer creepin' me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.11,0:35:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Nobita's really \Nbeing weird today...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.30,0:35:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Looks like this has a {\i1}REALLY {\i0}long-lasting effect...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.49,0:36:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}First-Time Stamp! Stamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.27,0:36:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Nobita! Yer such a \Ntru friend o' da heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.24,0:36:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's be friends forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.91,0:36:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.05,0:36:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.99,0:36:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's wagging it's tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.00,0:36:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}And it has it's \Ntongue sticking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.98,0:36:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}'N it has really fluffy fur!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.43,0:36:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Dogs are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.74,0:36:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Maybe this is \Na bit {\i1}TOO {\i0}strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.71,0:36:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Man, thank goodness that thing's effects finally wore off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.59,0:36:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If I had been all mushy-gushy with Gian and Suneo any longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.30,0:36:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I don't know if I could have put up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.17,0:36:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Sorry, sorry. But isn't the First-Time Stamp pretty amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.08,0:36:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just by stamping someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.39,0:36:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}They can experience anything, as if it's their first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.95,0:36:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We're home!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.67,0:36:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.01,0:36:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}No, what's \Nwrong with {\i1}you{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.28,0:36:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That was something that happened a long, long time ago...!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.28,0:36:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But you still did it, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.65,0:36:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But, still...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.82,0:36:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No buts!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.91,0:37:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}They're still fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.86,0:37:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, why don't we try using this on them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.96,0:37:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Fine, I don't care anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.11,0:37:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Fine, do whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.25,0:37:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.25,0:37:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I never knew you were {\i1}that {\i0}kind of person way back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.25,0:37:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I thought you were so much kinder and sweeter...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.86,0:37:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Same to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.01,0:37:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}When we were newlyweds, you were so much more quiet and innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.99,0:37:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, I'm so blessed!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.60,0:37:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}To think I have such a wonderful woman as my wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.88,0:37:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I think so, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.18,0:37:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I don't think there's a man in this world more handsome and reliable than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.00,0:37:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Oh, Darling!\NHoney!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.68,0:37:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Isn't that great!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.19,0:37:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}I'm going to stamp you with the \NFirst-Time Stamp again tomorrow morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.01,0:37:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That way, you'll be able to feel like going to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.67,0:37:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.03,0:37:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, are you listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.14,0:38:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}What on Earth is \Nhe thinking about...?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.88,0:38:20.62,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\blur3}So at first, everything feels \Nso new and emotional, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.29,0:38:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wonder how I felt when I first went to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.13,0:38:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}I wonder if I \Nwas excited about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.30,0:38:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}No, no way \Nthat could be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.82,0:38:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right. I'll go check with the Time Machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.28,0:38:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll go back to the day before I started elementary school...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.29,0:39:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Someone's running around, and sounds happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.00,0:39:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It sounds like a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.02,0:39:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What are they doing up so late at night...?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.30,0:39:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh...? It's me, back when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.34,0:39:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.14,0:39:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Come on now, \Nit's time for beddy bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.26,0:39:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}He's been wearing his backpack \Neveryday, and he's really excited about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.14,0:39:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.33,0:39:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\q0}When I go to school, I'll be able to make \Na whole big bunch of friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.43,0:39:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yes, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.27,0:39:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And Teacher will teach me all kinds of neat things, won't he, Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.27,0:39:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.61,0:39:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow! I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.15,0:39:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Come on sweetie, take off your backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.71,0:39:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.16,0:39:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm going to school! I'm gonna go to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.45,0:39:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.29,0:39:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay, time to close those little eyes so you don't oversleep tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.29,0:39:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay! Good night, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.28,0:39:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.29,0:39:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Time sure flies, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.30,0:39:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It seems like just yesterday he was our new, little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.93,0:40:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And now he's already an elementary-schooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.66,0:40:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}I hope Nobita will always think school is a fun place.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.27,0:40:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I couldn't help but be excited about going to school way back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.28,0:40:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}When...? Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.03,0:40:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}How did I get like this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.54,0:40:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\i1}WAKE... UP!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.04,0:40:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Today's Monday!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.88,0:40:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What? You're already up...?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.26,0:40:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No matter what you say today, Nobita-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.57,0:40:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm going to make you go to school for sure, today!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.30,0:40:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I don't need that!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.97,0:40:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.31,0:40:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He's started being stubborn again!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.81,0:40:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He won't listen to anything I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.07,0:40:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.87,0:40:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun's saying he won't go to school again...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.84,0:41:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, brother. That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.40,0:41:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Isn't that what he {\i1}always{\i0} says?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.28,0:41:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Oh, come on! \NI don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.87,0:41:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, my! Nobi-chan goes to school this morning, doesn't he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.79,0:41:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's right! Nobita's going to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.29,0:41:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But he said that he's not going to go to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.33,0:41:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.29,0:41:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hurry, we've got to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.79,0:41:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh? You're all dressed and have your backpack on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.87,0:41:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Are you going to school, after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.30,0:41:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.26,0:41:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I can't help it if I don't like school.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.67,0:41:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}But I want to try my hardest to get through it, \Nwithout relying on the power of your gadgets!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.31,0:41:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow! Way to go! That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.31,0:41:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You have no idea how long I've been waiting for this day to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.55,0:41:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, you... Don't exaggerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.32,0:41:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.41,0:41:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.32,0:41:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}Are you going to \Nschool {\i1}all by yourself{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.66,0:41:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Are you really going to be okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.90,0:41:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Uh, yeah... I'll be fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.33,0:41:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.08,0:41:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Our little boy's growing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.52,0:41:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.54,0:42:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}They're so moved... \NJust like his first time going!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.57,0:42:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Look out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.30,0:42:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Make sure to look both ways before you cross at the crosswalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.00,0:42:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And make sure to tell your teacher if you accidentally wet yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.28,0:42:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Stop! You're embarrassing me!
